    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ciwa ca ŵanace ŵa Yelobowamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa ndaŵi jelejo Abiya, mwanace jwa Mwenye Yelobowamu, ŵatandite kulwala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yelobowamu ŵasalile ŵamkwawo kuti, “Mwale mwakulisisa kuti mundu jwalijose akam'manyilila kuti mli ŵamkwawo Yelobowamu, ni mjawule ku Shilo, kwakutama jwakulocesya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwa Mlungu Ahiya, jwele juŵasasile kuti une timbe mwenye jwa Aisalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumjigalile mikate likumi, makeke, ni soni libotolo lya uci. Mkamwusye yitiyimwonecele mwanace jwetu jwakulwalaju, nipo jwalakwe takamsalile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵamkwawo Yelobowamu ŵawete mwakulisisa kuti mundu akam'manyilila, nipo ŵajawile ku Shilo, ni ŵajile kwika ku nyumba ja Ahiya. Ahiya ŵaliji ŵangalola cenene, ligongo lya kucekulupa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵamsalile Ahiya kuti, “Ŵamkwawo Yelobowamu akwisa kukumwusya m'mwejo ya mwanace jwawo, jwali mkulwala. Tinamsalile yakuti mwajanje. Tayice akuno mwakulisisa. Taŵe mpela jwamkongwe jwa cilendo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵayice ŵamkwawo Yelobowamu, ŵalisisile kuŵa mpela mundu jwine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Ahiya piŵasipikene sajo syakwe ali mkwinjila pa mlango, ŵatite, “Jinjilani, ngumanyilila kuti m'mwejo mli ŵamkwawo Yelobowamu. Ligongo cici mkulisisa kuŵa mpela mundu jwine? Ngwete ngani jakusakala jakuti namsalile m'mwejo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mjawule, mkamsalile Mwenye Yelobowamu kuti AMBUJE, Mlungu jwa Aisalaeli, akuti, ‘Namsagwile m'mwejo pasikati pa ŵandu, ni namŵisile kuŵa ŵakwalamula ŵandu ŵangu Aisalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natyosisye ucimwene mwiŵasa lya Daudi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni kumpa m'mwejo. Nambo m'mwejo mkulekangana pa yitendo yenu ni Daudi, jwakutumicila jwangu, juŵalipelece kwa une ni mtima wakwe wosope, ŵaliji ŵakupikana malamusi gangu, nipo ŵatendaga yinasakaga une. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo m'mwejo mtesile ulemwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " wawukulungwa mnope, kulekangana ni acayimwene wosope ŵaŵajinjile kala, m'mweji mkanimjinjile ucimwene. M'mwejo munganile une, soni mundumbilisye pakujilambila milungu jimwagumbile ni golidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ligongo lya yindu yimtesileyi, tinalijonanje liŵasa lyenu lyosope. Tinamwulaje jwamlume jwalijose jwa mwiŵasa mwenu, kutandila kapolo mpaka mlukosyo. Tinalijonanje kwamtundu liŵasa lyenu lyosope, mpela mwele ukasajocela moto ndoŵe, mpaka kutinika syosope.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.15.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ayi 15:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalijose jwa mwiŵasa mwenu jutaciwila mu msinda, tacilidwa ni m'mbwa. Jwalijose jutaciwila mwitinji tacilidwa ni yijuni. Une AMBUJE, nguti myoyo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welewo ni utenga wa AMBUJE kwa ŵamkwenu. Sambano m'mwejo, ujilani kumangwenu. Nambo patimkajinjile mu msindamo, ndaŵi jijojo mwanace jwenu jwakulwalajo takawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu wosope ŵa mcilambo ca Isalaeli takalile malilo gakwe, nipo takamsice m'malembe. Pakuŵa mwa ŵandu wosope ŵa mwiŵasa lya Yelobowamu, jwalakwe peju ni jutacisicidwa mwilembe. Ligongo AMBUJE, Mlungu jwa Aisalaeli, amnonyele jwalakwe peju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Soni AMBUJE, tamsagule mwenye jwasambano jutalamulile cilambo ca Isalaeli, ni kuwujonanga mtundu wosope wa liŵasa lya Yelobowamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵa ŵamtumbilisye AMBUJE, ligongo lya kulipanganyicisya mlungu jwamkongwe, lina lyakwe Ashela. Myoyo AMBUJE tacipeleka cilango kwa jemanjajo, mpaka tacitenganyika mpela litete lya mu lusulo. Tacatyosya jemanjajo mcilambo ca cajila cino, ciŵacipelece AMBUJE kwa acinangolo ŵawo. Nipo tacabalalisya ku cilambo cili pesi pa Lusulo lwa Yufuleti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE tiŵajase ŵandu ŵa cilambo ca Isalaeli ligongo lya ulemwa wuŵatesile Yelobowamu, wele ŵatendekasisye ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli kuti nombe nawo alemwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵamkwawo Yelobowamu ŵatyosile kuja kumangwawo ku Tilisa. Pa ŵagambile kwinjila pa mlango wa nyumba jakwe, mwanace jula ŵawile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵajinji ŵa Isalaeli ŵalisile pa malilo gakwe nipo ŵamsicile m'malembe, mpela mwele muŵaŵecetele AMBUJE mula, kupitila mwa jwakulocesya Ahiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ciwa ca Yelobowamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Masengo gosope gaŵatesile Yelobowamu paŵaliji mwenye, kutandila muŵaputilaga ngondo ni muŵalamulilaga cilambo, silembedwe m'buku ja Mbili ja Ayimwene ŵa ku Isalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yelobowamu ŵaliji mwenye jwa cilambo ca Isalaeli kwa yaka 22. Ŵawile nipo ŵamsicile mwilembe, nipo Nadabu mwanace jwawo, ŵajinjile ucimwene m'malo mwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Lehobowamu jwa ku Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lehobowamu mwanace jwa Solomoni ŵaliji ni yaka 41, pa ndaŵi jiŵajinjilaga ucimwene wa ku Yuda. Ŵalamulile kwa yaka 17 ku Yelusalemu, msinda wele AMBUJE ŵawusagwile pa cilikati pa misinda josope ja mcilambo ca Isalaeli, kuti ŵandu akamlambileje kweleko. Mama ŵawo ŵaliji lina lyawo Naama, ŵakutyocela ku cilambo ca Aamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa Yuda ŵamtumbilisye AMBUJE, kulekangana ni muŵatendele acinangolo ŵawo wosope, ligongo lya kutenda yindu yakusakala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakuŵa nombe nawo ŵataŵile malo gakulambila milungu jine ja unami, soni ŵaŵisile yipilala ya maganga ni yimanyilo ya Ashela, mlungu jwamkongwe, pacanya pa matumbi ni pasi pa yitela yayikulungwakulungwa ya masamba gejinji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.17.9+2KI.17.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ayi 17:9-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konjecesya pa yindu yeleyi, ŵakundile acalume ni acakongwe kutenda cigwagwa, m'malo muŵapopelelaga milungu ja unamijo. Ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda ŵatendaga yindu yosope yakunyalaya yiŵatendaga mitundu ja ŵandu jele AMBUJE ŵajitopwele mcilambo ca Kenani, ndaŵi jiŵayikaga Aisalaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
